  "title": "Sherry Chicken Curry",
  "description": "Chicken breast simmered with sherry, beef bouillon, peanut butter and curry powder. Other spices and the addition of coconut milk all add up to an unusual, creamy curry chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "Rebecca Swift"
  ],
